<title>USA: InVision to make two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>InVision to make two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FOSTER CITY, California 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>InVision Technologies Inc said Tuesday its board had declared a two-for-one stock split, payable February 7, record January 17.</p>
<p>The split will double the number of shares outstanding to about 10 million, it said.</p>
